Fixes:
------

- Fix a deadlock in fifo open, that is a regression caused in 3.6.10
  Addresses: https://cygwin.com/pipermail/cygwin/2026-July/259884.html

- Fix a regression of console input where the input would be lost.
  Addresses: https://cygwin.com/pipermail/cygwin/2026-August/259915.html

- Fix the crash that occurs when getlocalename_l() is called for "C"
  locale.
  Addresses: https://cygwin.com/pipermail/cygwin/2026-August/259965.html

- Fix a bug in calculation of loadavg.

- Provide correct number of the threads in /proc/<pid>/stat and
  /proc/<pid>/status.

- Fix a regression of clipboard in Windows 10.
  Addresses: https://cygwin.com/pipermail/cygwin/2026-September/260058.html

- Fix a hang of the console process that occurs when the master_thread is
  terminated early.
  Addresses: https://cygwin.com/pipermail/cygwin/2026-September/260037.html

- Fix a few more historical console bugs.
